        <item>
            <title>0.0.5</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 22:19:25 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/prof18/slashgrab/main/appcast.xml</link>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Slashgrab 0.0.5</h2>
<ul>
<li>Restore Finder <strong>Copy Path</strong> after updating from 0.0.4.</li>
<li>Prevent stale Finder extension versions from adding duplicate <strong>Copy Path</strong> entries after future updates.</li>
<li>Add <strong>Copy Path</strong> to Finder’s contextual menu, using the <strong>Copy As</strong> format selected in Slashgrab.</li>
<li>Record Finder <strong>Copy Path</strong> actions in <strong>Recently grabbed</strong>, keeping copy history consistent with menu-bar drops.</li>
<li>Add a dedicated Settings window for launch at login, Finder extension setup, updates, and app information.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/prof18/slashgrab/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
